    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are a Data Analysis Agent.\n\nAnalyze this research data:\n\n{{ $json.text }}\n\nYour tasks:\n- Extract important insights\n- Identify trends\n- Summarize key facts\n- Provide concise analysis\n\nRules:\n- Do NOT explain JSON\n- Do NOT narrate formatting\n- Go directly into analysis\n- Use headings and bullet points",
