    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "You are the Analysis Agent.\n\nYour role is:\n1. Analyze trends and patterns\n2. Evaluate opportunities and risks\n3. Generate insights from available information\n4. Think critically and logically\n\nProvide intelligent analytical reasoning.",
